  "body": "Set across a generous 603sqm (approx.) section with a well-designed 285.97sqm (approx.) floor area, this impressive two-level residence delivers outstanding flexibility, space, and modern comfort. Thoughtfully configured for extended families or dual-living arrangements, the home features 6 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, 2 living areas, and excellent separation of space throughout.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is thoughtfully designed with exceptional granny potential in mind, offering outstanding flexibility for multi-generational living. It features two bedrooms, along with a living area and a full bathroom. This level also features a well-appointed bedroom with its own private ensuite, offering added convenience. This level provides excellent privacy and independence, making it ideal for extended family, guests, or semi self-contained living. \r\n\r\nUpstairs forms the main hub of the home, where a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area creates a welcoming space for everyday living and entertaining. The well-appointed kitchen is complemented by a generous island bench, quality appliances, and a spacious walk-in pantry to further enhance storage. A dedicated storage room ensuring both functionality and effortless organisation.\r\n\r\nAccommodation on this level includes the master bedroom with its own walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, along with two additional bedrooms that share a well-appointed family bathroom, offering a practical and well-balanced layout for family living.\r\n\r\nExtending effortlessly from the interior living spaces, the beautifully landscaped garden creates a private outdoor sanctuary framed by lush greenery and established plantings. The spacious deck provides the perfect setting for entertaining, relaxing, or enjoying time with family and friends. Thoughtfully designed to connect both levels of the home, the outdoor area enhances the sense of space and flow while creating a seamless relationship between indoor comfort and outdoor enjoyment.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\nA heat pump ensures daily comfort in granny potential\r\nCentral air-conditioning for year-round ease\r\nA double internal-access garage provides secure parking and additional storage\r\nIntercom system\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in a highly sought-after neighbourhood, the property is close to shopping centres, transport links, and excellent schools, including Orewa Primary School within walking distance-making it an outstanding choice for families seeking both convenience and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a spacious, versatile home designed for modern multi-generational living.\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing.",
